{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15776", "id": 3018370174, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAEfiCM6z6Kx-", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15776", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15776.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15776.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/15776", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15776/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15776/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/15776/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/28cc0f1165c03d5c287b808f88ae7e99494daf4f", "number": 15776, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix: Stabilize `XmlSafetyTest` by filtering child `sleep 60` processes using baseline diff", "user": {"login": "Anshul-creator", "id": 85193651, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1MTkzNjUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85193651?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator", "html_url": "https://github.com/Anshul-creator", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change?\r\n\r\nThis PR stabilizes `XmlSafetyTest` by removing environment-dependent flakiness in its process-inspection logic, while fully preserving the original test intention of detecting unsafe external command execution during XML deserialization.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n\r\n`XmlSafetyTest` verifies that calling `XmlCodec.decode(...)` does not spawn external commands such as `sleep 60`.  \r\nHowever, the original validation logic had two issues:\r\n\r\n1. It checked for `\"sleep\"` in the entire `ps -e` output *after* execution, without using the `processesBefore` baseline captured in `prepare()`.\r\n2. It monitored **all system processes**, meaning the test failed if any unrelated `sleep` process was created by the OS, CI infrastructure, or other tests running concurrently.\r\n\r\nAs a result, both `testSafe1` and `testSafe2` intermittently failed under randomized execution orders (NonDex) and on shared machines, even when `XmlCodec` did not spawn a process.\r\n\r\n## Changes Made\r\n\r\nOnly the `ProcessChecker` implementation was modified:\r\n\r\n- The current JVM PID is captured in `prepare()`.\r\n- `getProcesses()` was updated to only record processes where:\r\n  - The **parent PID matches the JVM**, ensuring they are child processes, and\r\n  - The command contains `\"sleep\"` **and** `\"60\"`, matching the attack payload.\r\n- The baseline comparison remains (`processesBefore` vs `processesAfter`), ensuring the test still fails if XML deserialization launches a new `sleep 60` process.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nYou can try running the following snippet of code from the dubbo repo root, on both pre-fix and post-fix code\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n./mvnw -pl dubbo-remoting/dubbo-remoting-http12 \\\r\n  edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.2.1:nondex \\\r\n  -DnondexRuns=50 \\\r\n  -Dtest=org.apache.dubbo.remoting.http12.message.codec.XmlSafetyTest\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe test should fail intermittently on the pre-fix version, but pass consistently across all seeds on the post-fix version.\r\nNonDex run logs will be available under the `dubbo-remoting/dubbo-remoting-http12/.nondex` directory.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Make sure there is a [GitHub_issue](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues) field for the change.\r\n- [x] Write a pull request description that is detailed enough to understand what the pull request does, how, and why.\r\n- [x] Write necessary unit-test to verify your logic correction. If the new feature or significant change is committed, please remember to add sample in [dubbo samples](https://github.com/apache/dubbo-samples) project.\r\n- [x] Make sure gitHub actions can pass. [Why the workflow is failing and how to fix it?](../CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:37:46Z", "updated_at": "2026-01-21T01:14:49Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-21T08:28:43Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-21T08:28:43Z", "merge_commit_sha": "9b32dc11eb3f2bd080f2b6e87591caba2ece0468", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "Anshul-creator:fix-XmlSafetyTest", "ref": "fix-XmlSafetyTest", "repo": {"id": 1076976850, "node_id": "R_kgDOQDFc0g", "name": "dubbo", "full_name": "Anshul-creator/dubbo", "owner": {"login": "Anshul-creator", "id": 85193651, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1MTkzNjUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85193651?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator", "html_url": "https://github.com/Anshul-creator", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/use